      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.002 (vs ₹1.44 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.002 (down from ₹1.44 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹135.8m (up 33% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.81m (down 24% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.1% (down from 3.6% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 54% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 151% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
